Package: zfstool
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, zfsutils-linux
Recommends: smartmontools
Description: read-only ZFS and host inspection tool (agent, web UI, GUI)
 zfstool runs a small agent that exposes pool and host data over a Unix
 socket (HTTP). The default command opens a local WebKit UI; zfstool web
 serves the same UI over HTTP. A systemd unit is included for the agent
 (zfstool-agent.service).
